# Copy to .dev.vars for local development (wrangler dev reads .dev.vars).
# .dev.vars is gitignored -- never commit real secrets.
#
# Production secrets are set via `wrangler secret put <NAME>`, never
# committed to this repo and never stored in wrangler.jsonc.

# Pepper mixed into PBKDF2 PIN hashing (defense in depth if the D1 database
# is ever exfiltrated without the Worker's environment). Generate with:
#   openssl rand -base64 32
PIN_HASH_PEPPER=
